### NestAI Sessions API 测试

### 1. 创建 Space
# 需要先有一张已上传的图片 URL
POST http://localhost:3000/api/spaces
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "images": [{"s3Url": "https://example.com/test.jpg", "uploadedAt": "2026-05-13T00:00:00Z"}]
}

### 2. 创建 Session
# 用上一步返回的 spaceId
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": "REPLACE_WITH_SPACE_ID"
}

### 3. 调用 Analyze (Prompt001)
# 用上一步返回的 sessionId
# 这会调用 LLM，需要配置 LLM_API_KEY
POST http://localhost:3000/api/sessions/REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. 获取 Session 详情
GET http://localhost:3000/api/sessions/REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID

### 5. 健康检查
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health
